"question_id":"CQ-Q0107","citation_id":"smp-ef6131e362f745da90481d8ba386deb9:33","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0107","question_id":"CQ-Q0107","citation_id":"smp-ef6131e362f745da90481d8ba386deb9:34","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0107","question_id":"CQ-Q0107","citation_id":"smp-ef6131e362f745da90481d8ba386deb9:35","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0107","question_id":"CQ-Q0107","question_text":"蝉圈圈怎么寄样？","category":"品牌认知型","pool":"清洗版补充池","sample_date":"2026-10-13","repeat_index":1,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":24,"valid_url_cards":18,"unique_url_events":10,"official_events":5,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"c3a139439bbb41f9f8545e5e334141c4c427b9e4b0eaaf51d837536083817d80","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":["explanation_accuracy","positioning_accuracy"],"recommendation_applicable":false,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# ✅蝉圈圈商家寄样操作（PC后台）\n入口：**合作管理 → 样品跟进**\n\n\n## 方式1：单个新增样品单（少量寄样）\n1. 点【新增样品单】\n2. 录入：达人信息、商品、收件人、电话、收货地址，填写约定的合作要求、发布时限\n3. 可**开启到样提醒**，达人签收系统自动通知你\n4. 仓库发出后，点【发货】，填入**快递单号**，系统识别物流公司，自动跟踪物流\n5. 保存，状态变为「已寄样」，达人那边会收到寄样通知卡片\n\n## 方式2：批量导入（大量达人寄样）\n1. 在样品跟进页，点击【批量导入样品单】\n2. 下载平台模板，一次性填好多位达人寄样信息\n3. 上传表格提交，批量生成样品单，适合商务大批量BD寄样\n\n## 方式3：推品小程序（达人主动申样，推荐）\n\n1. 后台上架样品商品，开启推品小程序\n2. 把小程序链接发给达人，达人在线选品、提交申样\n3. 你在后台**审核申样**，审核通过自动生成寄样单，可一键推到ERP直接发货\n4. 物流自动回传，全程状态：待审核→待寄样→已寄样→已签收，自动提醒\n\n## ERP自动同步（旺店通等）\n蝉圈圈可绑定旺店通ERP：\n- ERP仓库发货填单号，**物流信息自动回写到蝉圈圈样品单**，不用手动录单号；\n- 蝉圈圈样品单也可推送到ERP生成发货单，仓库直接打单出库\n\n## 寄样后跟进\n- 寄出：一键分享物流卡片给达人\n- 签收：系统自动提醒，及时跟进达人拍摄/开播履约\n- 达人履约后，可标记样品单完成；长期不履约可标记，规避骗样、防止重复寄样\n\n### 小提示\n- 寄样前建议和达人提前约定：样品是否返还、视频发布时限、未履约处理规则；\n- 系统自带**重复寄样检测**，避免同达人重复发样浪费样品成本。\n\n\n需要我给你一份蝉圈圈寄样给达人的简短沟通话术吗？","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0107","question_id":"CQ-Q0107","citation_id":"smp-686531fc7c774c86a262d33c8c215511:1","title":"达人合作纯佣坑位费怎么选?寄样管理提升ROI","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/1517.html","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/1517.html","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0107","question_id":"CQ-Q0107","citation_id":"smp-686531fc7c774c86a262d33c8c215511:2","title":"蝉圈圈的样品跟进功能简介 - 蝉妈妈运营圈","raw_url":"https://www.chanmama.com/yunyingquan/question/3088.html","normalized_url":"https://www.chanmama.com/yunyingquan/question/3088.html","host":"www.chanmama.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0107","question_id":"CQ-Q0107","citation_id":"smp-686531fc7c774c86a262d33c8c215511:3","title":"业务迁移-蝉圈圈批量导入样品单 - 蝉妈妈运营圈","raw_url":"https://www.chanmama.com/yunyingquan/question/3021","normalized_url":"https://www.chanmama.com/yunyingquan/question/3021","host":"www.chanmama.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0107","question_id":"CQ-Q0107","citation_id":"smp-686531fc7c774c86a262d33c8c215511:4","title":"蝉圈圈「推品小程序」:双11样品管理革命，解放品牌商务双手 - 蝉圈圈","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/841.html","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/841.html","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0107","question_id":"CQ-Q0107","citation_id":"smp-686531fc7c774c86a262d33c8c215511:5","title":"商务防骗样完全指南:三步策略让样品投放精准高效 - 蝉圈圈","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc